                        <handDesc>
                            <handNote><p>Letters are deely and sharply incised, and text is exceptionally neat, although to the naked eye the gap between surviving lines 5 and 6 appears to widen as the text moves to the right of the stone. All letters bare clear serifs, with long tail on "Q" in surviving line 2. Small triangular interpuncts.</p>
