                <p>
                    [---]R II, [quattuorvir] for the purposes of administering [justice], quinquennalis, [flamen] of Roma and Augustus, [curator] of the association of Roman citizens, military tribune in Britain for 7 years, prefect of cavalry in Cyrene for 6 years [---]. 
